    <string name="Rules_Of_Game">Rules of game</string>
    <string name="Long_Sentence_Rules">Tetrano is a two player game.\n
        Each player successively puts a ring on the game board in order to create a four-ring series of a color.\n
        This series can be:\n
        - concentric : 4 rings of different sizes are placed in the same square,\n
        - or linear : 4 rings of the same size, or arranged in an ascending or a descending order of size, are placed on a line, a column or a diagonal.\n
        The game ends when one of the players succeeds in creating a four-ring series in the color he chose.\n
        To play a ring, drag and drop it to the square in which you aim to put this ring.\n
        Have fun!</string>
